WEBVTT

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:02.060
Dream...

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.900
That day's dream...

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.780
The season that I ran with you...

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:11.660
The sparkling afternoon sunshine that I wished to last forever...

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:15.030
The same dream, repeating...

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.460
Like a broken record, many, many times...

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:51.240
The skies of the twilight with no time
toki no nai tasogare sora

